## 9 nguyên lý GRASP

Mọi gán trách nhiệm phải dựa trên: **Information Expert**, **Creator**, **Controller**, **Low Coupling**, **High Cohesion**, **Polymorphism**, **Pure Fabrication**, **Indirection**, **Protected Variations**.

- Controller: nhận & điều phối system event; **không** nhét business logic chi tiết.
- Creator: B tạo A nếu B chứa/ghi nhận/dùng mật thiết A hoặc có data khởi tạo A.
- Pure Fabrication: Service / Repository / Adapter khi Domain class không đủ High Cohesion / Low Coupling.

## GoF trọng tâm (NextGen POS → Game)

| GoF | POS (sách) | Gợi ý Game |
|-----|------------|------------|
| Adapter | External tax / credit auth | SDK input, cloud save, ad network |
| Factory | `ServicesFactory` | `EnemyFactory`, `ItemFactory` |
| Strategy | Pricing / discount | Damage formula, AI behavior, movement |
| Composite | `CompositePricingStrategy` | Buff/stack effects, quest conditions |
| Observer | Model ↔ UI | HP/UI, achievement, event bus |
| Facade | Subsystem API | `GameFacade` / scene bootstrap |

